@page "/faq"

<PageTitle>Frequently Asked Questions · JAS International</PageTitle>

<div class="shop-container py-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700 ring-1 ring-blue-600/20 mb-3">
            CUSTOMER HELP CENTER
        </span>
        <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-3">
            Frequently Asked Questions
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto">
            Everything you need to know about purchasing, shipping rates, warranty policies, and showroom visits.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
        <!-- FAQ 1 -->
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs group" open>
            <summary class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between list-none">
                <span>What are the shipping charges and delivery timelines?</span>
                <span class="text-slate-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">⌄</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">
                <p>We deliver nationwide across Bangladesh:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
                    <li><strong>Inside Khulna City:</strong> Delivery charge is ৳80. Orders are delivered within 24 hours.</li>
                    <li><strong>Outside Khulna (All Districts):</strong> Delivery charge is ৳130 via express courier (Sundarban / Steadfast / Pathao / eCourier). Delivery takes 2 to 4 business days.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ 2 -->
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs group">
            <summary class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between list-none">
                <span>Do you offer Cash on Delivery (COD)?</span>
                <span class="text-slate-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">⌄</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">
                Yes! We offer 100% Cash on Delivery across Bangladesh. You can inspect the outer packaging and pay the courier agent upon delivery. For high-value smartphones and laptops outside Khulna, a nominal advance courier booking deposit may be requested to confirm serious intent.
            </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ 3 -->
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs group">
            <summary class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between list-none">
                <span>Are all products brand new and authentic?</span>
                <span class="text-slate-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">⌄</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">
                Absolutely. Every gadget sold at JAS International is 100% authentic, brand-new, and sealed in manufacturer packaging. We never sell clones, replicas, or refurbished items unless explicitly labeled as pre-owned in a separate clearance category.
            </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ 4 -->
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs group">
            <summary class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between list-none">
                <span>How does the 7-day replacement warranty work?</span>
                <span class="text-slate-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">⌄</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">
                If your device exhibits an inherent manufacturer hardware defect within 7 days of delivery, you can bring it to our Khulna showroom or ship it back to us for verification. Upon diagnosis of a factory defect (without physical or liquid damage), we issue an immediate replacement unit.
            </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ 5 -->
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs group">
            <summary class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between list-none">
                <span>Can I pick up my order directly from the Khulna showroom?</span>
                <span class="text-slate-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">⌄</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">
                Yes! You are always welcome to pick up your order directly from our store located at <strong>Khulna Shopping Complex, 3rd Floor</strong>, Dakbangla, Khulna. You can test the gadget in person and complete payment at the counter.
            </div>
        </details>

        <!-- FAQ 6 -->
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs group">
            <summary class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-between list-none">
                <span>How can I check the status of my order?</span>
                <span class="text-slate-400 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">⌄</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-100 pt-3">
                Visit our <a href="/orders" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold underline">Your Orders</a> page. All previous orders placed on your device or linked to your customer account appear automatically with real-time fulfillment states.
            </div>
        </details>
    </div>

    <!-- Still Have Questions Banner -->
    <div class="mt-12 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900 text-white p-8 text-center sm:text-left flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold">Have a specific question not covered here?</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Our customer support specialists are ready to help you anytime.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0">
            <a href="tel:01711465078" class="btn-primary !bg-white !text-slate-950 hover:!bg-slate-100 !px-4 !py-2 text-xs font-semibold">
                Call 01711465078
            </a>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary !bg-white/10 !text-white !border-white/20 hover:!bg-white/20 !px-4 !py-2 text-xs">
                Send Inquiry
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
